http://www.redhat.com/legal/patent_policy.html


> and/or covered under DCMA.

Please explain this one.  I haven't yet begun to understand what 
you are implying here.

Also, please in the future research these things before making 
false assumptions and/or poor and unfounded accusations and/or 
spreading FUD.


