Hello,

It all depends upon what you upgrade from??? 

   RH-7.1 to RH-7.2 no known problems.
   RH-7.0 to RH-7.2 the initrd is not created, please see the archives
                             for directions on how to create the initrd by hand,
                             as a post install procedure. I should add this info
                             to the release notes.
   RH-6.2 to RH-7.2 Unknown.
   Tru64   to RH-7.2  Requires a clean install.

I hope this helps.

Best Regards,


--George

