Hi
here we have a cluster of 10 alpha, some of then are a600 some others
xp1000. I'm using RH 6.2 on them and we have mpich for parallel jobs.
i'm not using any kind of software for cluster management, but i got
a cd with some software called Cluster Managemente Utility (it's very
user friendly and i think it's for free), i just tried it once when the
machines arrived here. In fact while i was writing this i looked
at the mosix web site but it's made for x86 machine.

Here people uses the cluster mainly for molecular dinamics calculations!
we would find something to do with some more machines ;-)

