/sbin/advfs/advscan -r rz0 or whatever) after mounting, just copy over
/bin/ksh or /bin/sh to the root_domain you just mounted.  unmount, and you
should be done.

this is assuming you have any flavor of OSF hanging around...  booting into
single user probably wont work.  but you can try. b -fl cs

