I haven't seen the specific item you're talking about, but I bet it could be
made to work with minimal effort.  The current x86 arch. boards also use the
tach line from the fans.  You will have to re-wire the connector though,
because Alphas and x86 have different pinouts for the CPU fans.  (Alphas use
the center conductor for the tach sense line, x86 uses the center conductor
for +12v)
