  This really was just /sbin/init issue; I compiled
  newer SysVinit-2.78-19 and replaced old init and
  everything just worked!

  There wasn't pretty much difference between old and new
  init.c versions; I found only these:

  old code:
     tty.c_cflag |= HUPCL|CLOCAL    (line 687)


  new code:
     tty.c_cflag |= CREAD|HUPCL|CLOCAL


