Sorry to have bothered the list with the request for help
on the Java app failure.  I stumbled on a solution while
trying to fix the mwm mutation.

The reason mwm mutated on me when I installed RH7.2 is I
had been using openMotif's mwm under RH7.1.  Rebuilding
and installing from the source RPM from the RH7.1 CDs
appears to have restored usable mwm functionality.

By happenstance, eliminating lesstif (and ddd and nedit)
and adding openMotif happens to solve the Java app
failure.  It still warns about the socket() failure, but
it displays and seems to work fine.

Thanks.

