>		Status: D0 PME-Enable- DSel=0 DScale=0 PME-
>
>
>BTW: The linux version is stock RH 7.2.

This card will not work on stock Red Hat Linux 7.2, nor with
updates.  It's not supported in any official release of Red Hat
Linux for any architecture currently, however it is supported in 
our current beta for x86.  AGP cards are supported, however PCI 
Radeon's are supported only in 2D.  3D is experimental, although 
claimed to work on Alpha.  Untested with the 9000 series PCI 
though.

That doesn't give you complete answer, but gives you something to 
experiment with at least.

I've added your subdevice to pciids.sf.net


