If you have a zero length library the install
did not work and nothing will compile.
After you download the rpms and decrypt them
check the md5 sums

rpm --checksig cpml_ev5-5.2.0-2.alpha.rpm

If they are not right you cannot proceed.
There is nothing wrong with the rpms so DO NOT
use the "-force" switch this can only make
matters worse,

Stephen Lewis


