Craig,

I've got one of these beasts with a DAC960 PD running 7.2 fine. The 
firmware on the RAID is version 3.51, though. I believe that to go to 
version 3+ of the firmware requires two EEPROMS on the card. I don't 
know whether later revisions of v2 will work or not.

Also, I've not found a way to set up the RAID volumes on the Alpha. The 
couple of times I've had to do it I've had to take the card out of the 
machine and put it into an x86 box, with the drives connected and 
powered up. (It helps here that the 960PD is a PCI card).

Well, not sure if that's of any help to you or not. If you have any 
further questions, just ask. I've spent countless hours wrestling with 
the thing ;-)

Regards,
Leigh Anderson




