from what i remember, the DEC code is pretty much the core Mylex code
but a few tidbits to enable the StorageWorks Fault management from some
BA35x boxes and SCSI Device ID string hacks.  so to try to take a Mylex
branded card and blast DEC code on it might work?  if you run
ra200fwp.exe and it sees the card, then i guess it will work.  but i
could be completely wrong...hope you have a few boards that you can
experiment on ;-).
 
had that same problem with machine checks.  try putting the card into
bus 0/hose 0 then run ECU (EISA version for DUNIX).  then try to run RCU
again.  but that was on a AS2100A/RM.  (which is dying to run Linux some
day ;-) )
